B.JV={"kundalini yoga":0,"ashtanga yoga":1,"prenatal & postnatal yoga":2,"daily yoga & meditation":3,"chakra healing & energy work":4,"sound healing & relaxation":5,"yogic lifestyle talks & webinars":6,"reiki healing":7,"ice bath therapy":8,"sound healing gatherings":9,"nature retreats & wellness events":10}
B.Jg=new A.bz(B.JV,["Unlock your inner power and elevate your energy with Kundalini Yoga\u2014a dynamic blend of movement, breathwork, mantra, and meditation. Known as the \u201cyoga of awareness\u201d it\u2019s designed to awaken your dormant energy and bring clarity, vitality, and deep inner peace. Whether you're looking to reduce stress, boost creativity, or connect with your higher self, Kundalini offers a powerful path to transformation. Each session leaves you feeling refreshed, centered, and more connected to your purpose. It\u2019s not just a workout\u2014it\u2019s a wake-up call for your soul. Ready to rise? Your energy is waiting.","Ignite your discipline and dive into a powerful flow with Ashtanga Yoga\u2014a structured, breath-led practice that builds strength, flexibility, and focus. Rooted in tradition, this dynamic sequence keeps your body moving and your mind steady. Our online classes offer guidance for all levels, from complete beginners to experienced practitioners, with modifications and support to grow at your pace. Ashtanga challenges and transforms, helping you tune into your breath, your body, and your inner resilience. Practice live or on-demand from wherever you are, and watch how consistency on the mat spills into clarity in life. It\u2019s yoga with purpose and fire.","Nurture your body and soul during and after pregnancy with our gentle, supportive Prenatal & Postnatal Yoga classes. These sessions are thoughtfully designed to ease discomfort, build strength, and support emotional balance throughout your motherhood journey. From breathwork to mindful movement, each class helps you feel more connected\u2014to your baby, your body, and your breath. Postnatal sessions offer safe reintroduction to movement, honoring the changes your body has gone through. Whether you're a glowing mom-to-be or newly postpartum, our online platform lets you join from home, on your schedule, with expert guidance every step of the way. You've got this!","Refresh your mind and move your body every day with our Daily Yoga & Meditation sessions. These online classes are short, effective, and soul-soothing\u2014perfect for starting your morning or winding down in the evening. Each session blends mindful movement, focused breathwork, and stillness to bring clarity, energy, and calm to your day. No matter your experience level, you\u2019ll find space to grow, reset, and simply breathe. With live and recorded options, you can build a daily habit that fits your rhythm. It\u2019s not just self-care\u2014it\u2019s your daily dose of peace, movement, and inner balance, one breath at a time.","Balance your energy, align your emotions, and tap into your inner power with our Chakra Healing & Energy Work sessions. These online experiences blend guided meditations, visualizations, breathwork, and subtle body awareness to activate and harmonize your seven energy centers. Whether you're feeling stuck, scattered, or simply seeking clarity, chakra work helps you reset from the inside out. Our classes support emotional healing, mental clarity, and spiritual awakening\u2014all from the comfort of your home. Join live or access recordings anytime to experience energetic renewal at your pace. Let your energy flow freely and your spirit shine bright.",'Sink into deep rest and rejuvenation with Sound Healing & Relaxation sessions designed to soothe your nervous system and reset your energy. Using instruments like crystal bowls, gongs, and chimes, each session creates a vibrational bath that helps release stress, improve sleep, and balance emotions. You don\u2019t have to "do" anything\u2014just lie back, breathe, and let the sounds work their magic. Offered online, both live and recorded, it\u2019s your perfect escape from the chaos of daily life. Ideal for all levels, sound healing is a gentle yet powerful practice to restore harmony within. Relax, receive, and let go completely.',"Go beyond the mat and dive into the heart of yogic wisdom with our Yogic Lifestyle Talks & Webinars. Explore topics like mindfulness, Ayurveda, conscious living, relationships, and more\u2014all rooted in ancient teachings, made practical for modern life. Led by experienced guides and guest speakers, these sessions are rich with insight, tools, and inspiration to help you live a more balanced, meaningful life. Join live for interaction or watch recordings at your own pace. It\u2019s the perfect blend of soul food and self-development\u2014because yoga isn\u2019t just what you do, it\u2019s how you live. Learn, grow, and evolve\u2014on and off the mat.","Reiki healing is a holistic therapy originating from Japan that promotes physical, emotional, and spiritual well-being. Practitioners channel universal life energy through their hands to the recipient, aiming to balance the body\u2019s energy systems and stimulate natural healing. It is non-invasive, gentle, and can help reduce stress, anxiety, and pain while enhancing relaxation and mental clarity. Reiki also encourages emotional release, spiritual growth, and overall harmony. Often used alongside conventional medicine, it supports recovery and improves quality of life. While effects vary among individuals, Reiki is widely valued for its calming and restorative benefits.","Step into the chill and discover your strength with Ice Bath Therapy\u2014an invigorating, guided experience that challenges your limits and expands your resilience. As you immerse in the cold, your breath becomes your anchor, teaching your body to stay calm under stress. This practice is known to reduce inflammation, boost immunity, sharpen focus, and elevate mood. Done safely and mindfully, it\u2019s more than physical\u2014it\u2019s deeply mental and emotional. Join us offline in a supportive environment and leave feeling refreshed, empowered, and alive. It\u2019s not just cold water\u2014it\u2019s a gateway to personal power. Dare to feel fully awake?","Immerse yourself in the healing power of sound with our in-person Sound Healing Gatherings. Surrounded by soothing tones of singing bowls, gongs, and chimes, you'll enter a deep state of rest where your body can release, reset, and heal. These sessions go beyond relaxation\u2014they help regulate the nervous system, calm the mind, and balance your emotional energy. Held in serene, supportive settings, each gathering is a communal yet personal journey into stillness and peace. Whether you're new to sound healing or a seasoned listener, join us offline and let the vibrations wash over you. No words\u2014just pure, healing sound.","Escape the noise and return to your natural rhythm at our monthly Nature Retreats & Wellness Events. Set in breathtaking outdoor locations, these gatherings offer a soul-nourishing mix of yoga, meditation, healing practices, nature walks, and mindful connection. Whether it's a day retreat or a weekend immersion, every detail is designed to help you reset, recharge, and reconnect with yourself and the world around you. Share space with like-minded souls, breathe deeply, and rediscover what balance truly feels like. Offline, off-grid, and deeply restorative\u2014our retreats are your invitation to slow down and come home to you."],t.li)
